stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NEW
  NEW --> CONTEXT_READY: scope + owner + context
  CONTEXT_READY --> PLANNED: dependencies + entry/exit
  PLANNED --> IN_PROGRESS: eligible + assigned + policy
  IN_PROGRESS --> VERIFYING: structured result
  VERIFYING --> HUMAN_REVIEW: checks + evidence
  HUMAN_REVIEW --> APPROVED: authorized receipt
  APPROVED --> PUBLISHED: governed publication
  PUBLISHED --> CLOSED: reconciliation + state delta

  NEW --> BLOCKED: missing requirement
  CONTEXT_READY --> BLOCKED: dependency or access
  PLANNED --> BLOCKED: gate not satisfied
  IN_PROGRESS --> DEGRADED: partial capability
  VERIFYING --> REJECTED: verification or review failed
  HUMAN_REVIEW --> REJECTED: rejected with rationale
  BLOCKED --> CONTEXT_READY: blocker resolved
  DEGRADED --> IN_PROGRESS: capability restored
  REJECTED --> IN_PROGRESS: authorized rework
  NEW --> CANCELLED: authorized cancellation
  IN_PROGRESS --> CANCELLED: authorized cancellation

